  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Make source-card names static labels instead of the implicit chart-focus click target.\n- Add explicit `Focus chart →` / `Clear focus` controls for source filtering.\n- Rename the upstream repository affordance to `Repos →` and update the subtitle copy to match the new interaction.\n- Add template regression assertions for the new affordances and for removal of the old source-name click guidance.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `uv run python -m unittest tests.test_app tests.test_readme -v`\n- `uv run python -m py_compile app.py scripts/snapshot_dashboard.py`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `scripts/review.sh`\n- Browser smoke test with simulated data at `http://127.0.0.1:8332/?simulate=1`",
  "changed_files": 2,
